@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
title 本週會遇到的例外類別（都是 JDK 內建，java.lang 套件）

legend top right
  <back:#FDE2E0>　非受檢：編譯器不強制處理　</back>
  <back:#E3ECF8>　受檢：編譯器要求 catch 或宣告 throws　</back>
endlegend

class Throwable #F4F4F4
class Exception #F4F4F4
class RuntimeException #FDE2E0
class IllegalArgumentException #FDE2E0 {
  reserve 自己 throw（A2）
}
class NumberFormatException #FDE2E0 {
  Integer.parseInt 失敗時拋出
}
class ClassCastException #FDE2E0 {
  上週 ai-check 看過
}
class InterruptedException #E3ECF8 {
  Thread.join() 宣告可能拋出（B2）
}
Throwable <|-- Exception
Exception <|-- RuntimeException
Exception <|-- InterruptedException
RuntimeException <|-- IllegalArgumentException
RuntimeException <|-- ClassCastException
IllegalArgumentException <|-- NumberFormatException
note right of NumberFormatException
  NumberFormatException <b>is-a</b> IllegalArgumentException
  → catch 父類別也會接住子類別
  → 兩個 catch 時，<b>子類別要放前面</b>（A3）
end note
@enduml
